  "content": "\n\n<a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=3266\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6pLLiYf.png\"></a>\n<h2><strong>Wall-Jump TXF 模組</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wall-jump-txf\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_909143_downloads.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載數\" /></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/wall-jump-txf\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/dynamic/json?color=2d2d2d&amp;colorA=17b85a&amp;style=flat-square&amp;label=&amp;suffix= downloads&amp;query=downloads&amp;url=https://api.modrinth.com/v2/project/oUoetxfR&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=2d2d2d\" alt=\"Modrinth 下載數\" /></a></p>\n\n壁跳、二段跳、越柵欄跳躍等更多功能\n\n<strong>本模組新增：</strong>\n\n<strong>貼牆：</strong>朝牆面跳躍並按住壁跳按鍵（左 Shift）\n\n<strong>壁跳：</strong>貼牆時持續按住 W 並放開左 Shift 即可進行壁跳\n\n<strong>二段跳：</strong>可選的空中跳躍功能\n\n<strong>加速：</strong>疾跑或搭乘鞘翅飛行時提升移動速度\n\n<strong>陡坡輔助：</strong>即使在空中也能走上台階，還能跳過柵欄\n\n<strong>Fabric/Quilt 相依模組：</strong>\n\n- <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\" target=\"_blank\">Mod Menu 模組</a> <strong>（選填）</strong>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/oUoetxfR/images/ccab85538f124c14fc7b772ddaff7c4c4097593a.png\">",
